{title: Bhula Do Bhula Do}
{artist: Raeth}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
Bhu [Am] la do bhula do woo [G] baate purani,        jo [F] dil ko jalati [E] rahi
woo [Am] yaade tumhari woo [G] baate tumhari,        jo [F] hum ko satati [E] rahi
bhu [Am] la do bhula do woo [G] baate purani,        jo [F] dil ko jalati [E] rahi
woo [Am] yaade tumhari woo [G] baate tumhari,        jo [F] hum ko satati [E] rahi
[Am] ooooooooooo [G] oooooooo [F] oooooo [E],        [Am] ooooooooooo [G] oooooooo [F] oooooo [E]
[Am] woo kaisi [G] subah thi,        [F] khushyon ka tha [E] safar
[Am] sab yaar [G] sang thay,        [F] koi thi na fi [E] kar
[Am] dukh aiya, [G] sukh khoiya,        [F] ghum ban giya hum [E] safar
[Am] apne kya, [G] paraiye kya,        [F] sab rang hain ek [E] say
[Am] kache sab [G] dhage hain,        [F] yeah band hain raeth [E] ke
[Am] manzil na [G] saathi hai,        [F] chalta hon main bekha [E] bar
[Am] ooooooooooo [G] oooooooo [F] oooooo [E],        [Am] ooooooooooo [G] oooooooo [F] oooooo [E]
